[
  {
    "key": "v_fc0a5d663b2a",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "And that one looks like the old Stonecrown fortress.",
    "direction": "gruff, recognising it",
    "seconds": 3.04
  },
  {
    "key": "v_f3a5f8b3a11b",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "Beautiful until you have to cross it carrying supplies.",
    "direction": "dry, grumbling",
    "seconds": 3.04
  },
  {
    "key": "v_82ab83d9f3cc",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "Everyone listen! Nobody goes past the north marker without an escort.",
    "direction": "shouting to a crowd, commanding",
    "seconds": 4.6
  },
  {
    "key": "v_2693ed66d3b4",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "Good. I need somebody who knows how to build a proper barricade.",
    "direction": "turning, pleased to see him",
    "seconds": 3.6
  },
  {
    "key": "v_bc0b09f1f795",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "He said you tried building a tunnel beneath the village.",
    "direction": "teasing, building to the punchline",
    "seconds": 2.96
  },
  {
    "key": "v_e07fcf0c4106",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "I was hoping you'd volunteer.",
    "direction": "dry, a hint of a smile",
    "seconds": 1.92
  },
  {
    "key": "v_6692f44d9b62",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "I'll clear the other side!",
    "direction": "shouting, already moving",
    "seconds": 1.92
  },
  {
    "key": "v_afa12cfce341",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "Luck won't keep us safe forever.",
    "direction": "grim, quiet",
    "seconds": 2.0
  },
  {
    "key": "v_2e4a99aee249",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "Nicely done.",
    "direction": "out of breath, approving",
    "seconds": 1.36
  },
  {
    "key": "v_693a64d5be1a",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "No. I closed the trail before the traders reached it.",
    "direction": "steady",
    "seconds": 3.12
  },
  {
    "key": "v_5f5abf5ae502",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "Nobody here.",
    "direction": "wary, scanning the empty camp",
    "seconds": 3.36
  },
  {
    "key": "v_3ed8fb73d581",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "Of course that's your answer.",
    "direction": "exasperated, half amused",
    "seconds": 1.76
  },
  {
    "key": "v_59c1e2fb193c",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "Or somebody made them leave.",
    "direction": "low, grim",
    "seconds": 1.92
  },
  {
    "key": "v_9bf6e42b8de7",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "Recently?",
    "direction": "wary, low",
    "seconds": 1.2
  },
  {
    "key": "v_7876e8e1cf3c",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "Rowan said you were always getting into trouble as a child.",
    "direction": "gruff, amused, teasing",
    "seconds": 3.36
  },
  {
    "key": "v_2263f5ef058e",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "Steve! Elder!",
    "direction": "calling out, jogging up",
    "seconds": 1.84
  },
  {
    "key": "v_2b9fa8e4e551",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "That's bigger than it looked from the watchtower.",
    "direction": "impressed, a little uneasy, looking up",
    "seconds": 2.96
  },
  {
    "key": "v_1d92e4e0b119",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "The northern path isn't safe. Loose rocks came down just before dawn.",
    "direction": "firm, reporting",
    "seconds": 4.4
  },
  {
    "key": "v_fdb2870d550f",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "The trail's closed past the old posts, but the Elder says you two may pass. Mind the loose rock.",
    "direction": "gruff but friendly, matter-of-fact",
    "seconds": 6.0
  },
  {
    "key": "v_d417a77ea566",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "Then we're not staying here after dark.",
    "direction": "firm, decisive, uneasy",
    "seconds": 2.16
  },
  {
    "key": "v_4a71c53d295a",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "Then you won't mind waiting until we know it's safe.",
    "direction": "flat, unimpressed",
    "seconds": 2.72
  },
  {
    "key": "v_3c74480d5ec8",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "There it is again.",
    "direction": "tense, as the ground trembles",
    "seconds": 1.36
  },
  {
    "key": "v_90dbbc54812a",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "Who sent them?",
    "direction": "suspicious",
    "seconds": 1.28
  },
  {
    "key": "v_b6f27fa18fb3",
    "speaker": "bram",
    "text": "You flooded three houses.",
    "direction": "flat, deadpan",
    "seconds": 1.76
  },
  {
    "key": "v_5e9702a58eaf",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "And he's usually right.",
    "direction": "playful",
    "seconds": 1.44
  },
  {
    "key": "v_802d4d27bb58",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "And it's getting stronger.",
    "direction": "uneasy",
    "seconds": 1.28
  },
  {
    "key": "v_c9195865a6f7",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Beautiful, isn't it?",
    "direction": "wistful, admiring the view",
    "seconds": 1.28
  },
  {
    "key": "v_22e612076827",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Below the monument?",
    "direction": "surprised, uneasy",
    "seconds": 1.28
  },
  {
    "key": "v_41d5b4e0247e",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Different how?",
    "direction": "uneasy",
    "seconds": 1.04
  },
  {
    "key": "v_41da756d4212",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Feel what?",
    "direction": "puzzled",
    "seconds": 0.8
  },
  {
    "key": "v_78ba35e16655",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Have you ever wondered what's beyond the kingdoms?",
    "direction": "dreamy, curious, walking",
    "seconds": 2.08
  },
  {
    "key": "v_94ff93bb7da8",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "He's serious, Steve.",
    "direction": "quietly, nudging him",
    "seconds": 1.28
  },
  {
    "key": "v_43c01f9a55c6",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "I hope so.",
    "direction": "softly, worried",
    "seconds": 0.96
  },
  {
    "key": "v_d8d229140ffc",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "I know this valley. I've crossed it since I was a child.",
    "direction": "wistful, troubled",
    "seconds": 3.12
  },
  {
    "key": "v_21d60574703c",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "I think something happened here that neither of us understands.",
    "direction": "serious, unsettled",
    "seconds": 2.88
  },
  {
    "key": "v_b06878d9f022",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "I thought you'd say that.",
    "direction": "fond, knowing smile",
    "seconds": 1.12
  },
  {
    "key": "v_14ce6933c04c",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "I wish every morning was this quiet.",
    "direction": "content, sighs happily",
    "seconds": 2.24
  },
  {
    "key": "v_e275ee3520b1",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "I'll mark this place on the map. Before we go any further, we need proper surveying gear from Orin.",
    "direction": "practical, determined",
    "seconds": 4.8
  },
  {
    "key": "v_9824e028ab41",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "I'm serious.",
    "direction": "mildly annoyed, smiling",
    "seconds": 1.04
  },
  {
    "key": "v_28bd48815627",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "It keeps swinging north... then away again.",
    "direction": "watching closely",
    "seconds": 3.12
  },
  {
    "key": "v_01fee40899c8",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Look at their shapes. That one resembles the towers of Eldervale.",
    "direction": "intrigued, pointing something out",
    "seconds": 3.6
  },
  {
    "key": "v_b065ffdd43ed",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Look at this drawing.",
    "direction": "holding out the page",
    "seconds": 2.24
  },
  {
    "key": "v_c25f56cb328d",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Look at this.",
    "direction": "quietly, kneeling to look",
    "seconds": 0.96
  },
  {
    "key": "v_4ea220e9b28d",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Maybe that's exactly how it feels.",
    "direction": "softly, hurt",
    "seconds": 1.84
  },
  {
    "key": "v_d116beca16be",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Maybe the other kingdoms have seen these symbols.",
    "direction": "hopeful, thoughtful",
    "seconds": 2.16
  },
  {
    "key": "v_36bcf5409f72",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Maybe they carried it with them.",
    "direction": "thoughtful",
    "seconds": 1.36
  },
  {
    "key": "v_49240f6484c1",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Maybe. But the tracks stop here.",
    "direction": "uneasy",
    "seconds": 2.48
  },
  {
    "key": "v_6a8f8a6738d3",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Nobody leaves a lantern behind out here. Look at those rocks. Someone climbed them.",
    "direction": "worried, then pointing",
    "seconds": 4.5
  },
  {
    "key": "v_f27d2ebfab4c",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Nothing in Firstbrook is heavy enough to do that.",
    "direction": "unsettled",
    "seconds": 2.32
  },
  {
    "key": "v_bdb293578231",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Or to the equipment you're carrying. We don't know yet.",
    "direction": "cautious, thoughtful",
    "seconds": 2.64
  },
  {
    "key": "v_6ad28a56b7d7",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Orin said you'd sleep until noon if nobody checked.",
    "direction": "teasing",
    "seconds": 2.56
  },
  {
    "key": "v_80292b2340bd",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Orin, what are they pointing toward?",
    "direction": "curious, careful",
    "seconds": 1.68
  },
  {
    "key": "v_8deb0348f0c5",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Six points.",
    "direction": "softly, in awe",
    "seconds": 1.36
  },
  {
    "key": "v_a8c05446f121",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Someone from Sylvaris knows about this site.",
    "direction": "serious, determined",
    "seconds": 2.32
  },
  {
    "key": "v_ec48570c0c2c",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Someone's been here.",
    "direction": "hushed, alert, looking into the distance",
    "seconds": 1.2
  },
  {
    "key": "v_9f43096a21ef",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Steve! Move away!",
    "direction": "shouting, alarmed, urgent",
    "seconds": 1.68
  },
  {
    "key": "v_f41d0b0e5c49",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Steve! You awake in there?",
    "direction": "calling through a window, cheerful",
    "seconds": 1.84
  },
  {
    "key": "v_663ce0f9b839",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Sylvaris.",
    "direction": "recognising a symbol, quiet realisation",
    "seconds": 3.36
  },
  {
    "key": "v_4a938f8ef96d",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "That's something, I suppose.",
    "direction": "laughs softly",
    "seconds": 1.44
  },
  {
    "key": "v_4790e5de4fc3",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "That's where I was heading.",
    "direction": "eager",
    "seconds": 1.12
  },
  {
    "key": "v_205abfb36eb3",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "The fire's cold, but these supplies haven't been here long.",
    "direction": "crouching, examining, puzzled",
    "seconds": 2.88
  },
  {
    "key": "v_3e372d672aed",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "The outer walls weren't visible yesterday.",
    "direction": "thoughtful, observant",
    "seconds": 2.08
  },
  {
    "key": "v_da9d5d67f118",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "The ruins? Nobody's been working there.",
    "direction": "surprised",
    "seconds": 2.24
  },
  {
    "key": "v_bbfdfc948655",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Then this is the last place anyone saw them... if anyone did.",
    "direction": "low, uneasy",
    "seconds": 3.76
  },
  {
    "key": "v_07a5ca18ba60",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Then where are the marks on the rock?",
    "direction": "sharp, doubtful",
    "seconds": 1.68
  },
  {
    "key": "v_d641ecba99b0",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "There are maps older than anyone in Firstbrook. Some have places nobody remembers.",
    "direction": "earnest, quietly fascinated",
    "seconds": 4.9
  },
  {
    "key": "v_dc5b57d61394",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "There it is.",
    "direction": "hushed, awed, looking into the distance",
    "seconds": 0.96
  },
  {
    "key": "v_332e93524e9f",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "These have stood for a hundred years. And there's another stone further up. Look at it.",
    "direction": "troubled, then urgent",
    "seconds": 4.3
  },
  {
    "key": "v_4b3d1642161f",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "These people were mapping the same markings we found.",
    "direction": "reading a journal, intrigued",
    "seconds": 3.04
  },
  {
    "key": "v_84e2f48b3452",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "They saw it too. So it wasn't just the ground.",
    "direction": "quiet realisation",
    "seconds": 2.56
  },
  {
    "key": "v_1508f4c6e53f",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "We found markings near the northern path.",
    "direction": "earnest, getting to the point",
    "seconds": 2.24
  },
  {
    "key": "v_ebb322ac8b43",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "Yes.",
    "direction": "stunned, quiet",
    "seconds": 0.72
  },
  {
    "key": "v_47e01bb41d97",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "You mean Bram watched while you did everything?",
    "direction": "skeptical, teasing",
    "seconds": 2.48
  },
  {
    "key": "v_44218d1a2d3b",
    "speaker": "elara",
    "text": "You repaired the eastern bridge yesterday?",
    "direction": "curious",
    "seconds": 1.92
  },
  {
    "key": "v_98bead65e6ba",
    "speaker": "elder_rowan",
    "text": "Almost deliberate.",
    "direction": "quietly, ominous",
    "seconds": 2.16
  },
  {
    "key": "v_4d3f16b67035",
    "speaker": "elder_rowan",
    "text": "Exactly. The ground shook, and the watchtower reported strange lights beneath the stone.",
    "direction": "serious",
    "seconds": 6.3
  },
  {
    "key": "v_0fde975ecd9f",
    "speaker": "elder_rowan",
    "text": "First, prepare properly. There'll be no heroics today.",
    "direction": "stern, fatherly",
    "seconds": 4.5
  },
  {
    "key": "v_09e5907c585c",
    "speaker": "elder_rowan",
    "text": "Good. I'd rather lose a morning of trading than a single life.",
    "direction": "approving, warm",
    "seconds": 4.3
  },
  {
    "key": "v_c15abc053940",
    "speaker": "elder_rowan",
    "text": "I lived through earthquakes when I was younger. This felt different.",
    "direction": "thoughtful, heavy",
    "seconds": 4.8
  },
  {
    "key": "v_da17d6d0ce3b",
    "speaker": "elder_rowan",
    "text": "Not alone. We need to know what we're dealing with.",
    "direction": "firm but kind",
    "seconds": 3.52
  },
  {
    "key": "v_65a8cd38dd5b",
    "speaker": "elder_rowan",
    "text": "Something happened near the old northern ruins before sunrise.",
    "direction": "grave, lowered voice",
    "seconds": 5.6
  },
  {
    "key": "v_ad1ea1003679",
    "speaker": "elder_rowan",
    "text": "Steve! There you are.",
    "direction": "warm, relieved, calling out",
    "seconds": 2.32
  },
  {
    "key": "v_5cfbf88377de",
    "speaker": "elder_rowan",
    "text": "Steve, I've been looking everywhere for you.",
    "direction": "urgent, a little out of breath",
    "seconds": 2.64
  },
  {
    "key": "v_0a20325b6403",
    "speaker": "elder_rowan",
    "text": "Then we proceed carefully.",
    "direction": "calm, measured, wise",
    "seconds": 2.16
  },
  {
    "key": "v_9c17574158b6",
    "speaker": "expedition_worker_1",
    "text": "Help! I can't get through!",
    "direction": "panicked, shouting from behind rubble",
    "seconds": 1.84
  },
  {
    "key": "v_ee035f42c275",
    "speaker": "firstbrook_farmer_1",
    "text": "Morning, Steve!",
    "direction": "calling out warmly from a field",
    "seconds": 1.36
  },
  {
    "key": "v_5ac724c11b93",
    "speaker": "firstbrook_villager_2",
    "text": "It's just an old ruin.",
    "direction": "dismissive, rolling his eyes",
    "seconds": 2.32
  },
  {
    "key": "v_eceed1fd39de",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "All three? At exactly the same time?",
    "direction": "incredulous, sharp",
    "seconds": 3.12
  },
  {
    "key": "v_b05a69b66304",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "Before you ask, no, I haven't worked out what happened.",
    "direction": "gruff, not looking up from his work",
    "seconds": 4.1
  },
  {
    "key": "v_fa3b6149e56f",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "Did you both see that?",
    "direction": "breathless, astonished",
    "seconds": 1.52
  },
  {
    "key": "v_a51a067cf02c",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "Glad we've established that.",
    "direction": "dry, sardonic",
    "seconds": 1.92
  },
  {
    "key": "v_dc85ffc35c2b",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "I don't know. But somebody wanted them remembered together.",
    "direction": "slow, reverent, studying the carving",
    "seconds": 4.5
  },
  {
    "key": "v_f059c8956f8e",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "I saw. It started before your hand reached the stone.",
    "direction": "quiet, unsettled, certain",
    "seconds": 4.3
  },
  {
    "key": "v_0159c1f8d3b2",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "I've tried three compasses. Every single one is wrong.",
    "direction": "frustrated, exasperated old scholar",
    "seconds": 4.2
  },
  {
    "key": "v_7c3325dd447b",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "Markings?",
    "direction": "pausing, suddenly interested",
    "seconds": 1.2
  },
  {
    "key": "v_f86da225263f",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "Not exactly. That structure doesn't match any record I've seen.",
    "direction": "slow, troubled, unusually serious",
    "seconds": 5.2
  },
  {
    "key": "v_ad56bbf9bfb7",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "Possibly. Or six settlements.",
    "direction": "considering, scholarly",
    "seconds": 3.12
  },
  {
    "key": "v_640bdb28c20c",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "That's not a natural crack.",
    "direction": "low, troubled, examining it closely",
    "seconds": 2.16
  },
  {
    "key": "v_edcbcdba3121",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "That's what worries me.",
    "direction": "quiet, worried",
    "seconds": 1.68
  },
  {
    "key": "v_b7cd1fb06359",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "Then where?",
    "direction": "urgent, impatient",
    "seconds": 1.2
  },
  {
    "key": "v_704924be5942",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "They've been buried for generations. The disturbance must've exposed them.",
    "direction": "old scholar, explaining, slightly breathless from the climb",
    "seconds": 4.7
  },
  {
    "key": "v_0e43dbfe52f0",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "This time, don't.",
    "direction": "firm, flat warning",
    "seconds": 1.52
  },
  {
    "key": "v_2c717c42e9b5",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "Very serious. I want measurements before somebody destroys the evidence.",
    "direction": "grave, deliberate",
    "seconds": 5.1
  },
  {
    "key": "v_dfca4b6aabac",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "We're going to need information from outside Firstbrook.",
    "direction": "decisive, serious",
    "seconds": 4.0
  },
  {
    "key": "v_c6cd4729ec3a",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "Whatever is buried beneath that structure.",
    "direction": "low, ominous, staring at the monument",
    "seconds": 3.2
  },
  {
    "key": "v_599bf7d86150",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "Where did you find that?",
    "direction": "sharp, serious now",
    "seconds": 1.6
  },
  {
    "key": "v_d0cf37442379",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "You can break most stone with a good pickaxe.",
    "direction": "gruff, lecturing",
    "seconds": 2.96
  },
  {
    "key": "v_71289f51446d",
    "speaker": "orin",
    "text": "Your faces asked for you.",
    "direction": "dry, deadpan",
    "seconds": 2.24
  },
  {
    "key": "v_8c8553511a43",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "A bedroll, a cold fire and a pack. The scout was here.",
    "direction": "taking it in, grim",
    "seconds": 4.0
  },
  {
    "key": "v_0719396865c5",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "A scout's lantern. Still half full of oil.",
    "direction": "examining, puzzled",
    "seconds": 3.04
  },
  {
    "key": "v_a6fc22ed324d",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "A traveller?",
    "direction": "curious",
    "seconds": 1.28
  },
  {
    "key": "v_e269bd5e5627",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "An earthquake?",
    "direction": "uncertain",
    "seconds": 1.2
  },
  {
    "key": "v_54f13f7d4cea",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Another morning.",
    "direction": "sleepily, warm",
    "seconds": 1.28
  },
  {
    "key": "v_f74388879940",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Anyone hurt?",
    "direction": "quick, worried",
    "seconds": 1.04
  },
  {
    "key": "v_9cbd9853724e",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Below.",
    "direction": "quiet, looking down at the needle",
    "seconds": 0.8
  },
  {
    "key": "v_d334f39b3848",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Did you feel that?",
    "direction": "uneasy, quiet",
    "seconds": 1.2
  },
  {
    "key": "v_6638a2a836e3",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Did you see that?",
    "direction": "startled, breathless",
    "seconds": 1.12
  },
  {
    "key": "v_f04e14b125e6",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Don't say that. Something always happens when somebody says that.",
    "direction": "half-joking, wary",
    "seconds": 3.68
  },
  {
    "key": "v_e4fcc7e908bf",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Farther than that, I think.",
    "direction": "thoughtful, unsettled, slow",
    "seconds": 2.24
  },
  {
    "key": "v_89817c55e8f0",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "He carried the wood.",
    "direction": "deadpan",
    "seconds": 1.2
  },
  {
    "key": "v_b7d59a68dce3",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "He exaggerates.",
    "direction": "dismissive, light",
    "seconds": 1.6
  },
  {
    "key": "v_8babe1403d45",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "How do you know?",
    "direction": "curious",
    "seconds": 1.12
  },
  {
    "key": "v_d3e80de41e0f",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "I am now.",
    "direction": "groggy, amused",
    "seconds": 1.2
  },
  {
    "key": "v_cc136038b5bc",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "I didn't touch anything.",
    "direction": "shaken, defensive, stepping back",
    "seconds": 1.44
  },
  {
    "key": "v_535a8a387724",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "I said it would've worked.",
    "direction": "stubborn, comic insistence",
    "seconds": 2.0
  },
  {
    "key": "v_71f6cec37f68",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "I'll have a look.",
    "direction": "determined",
    "seconds": 1.12
  },
  {
    "key": "v_d83f6a6e269b",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "It would've worked.",
    "direction": "defensive, completely sincere",
    "seconds": 1.44
  },
  {
    "key": "v_865a63c8b87a",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "It's a good answer.",
    "direction": "grinning, confident",
    "seconds": 1.44
  },
  {
    "key": "v_fbbe6b72be21",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Let's find out.",
    "direction": "determined, setting off",
    "seconds": 1.28
  },
  {
    "key": "v_9678e8197911",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Like the monument carving.",
    "direction": "realising, quiet",
    "seconds": 1.68
  },
  {
    "key": "v_f4832db35c51",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Maybe they're all broken.",
    "direction": "casual, shrugging",
    "seconds": 1.6
  },
  {
    "key": "v_2896f69b51b1",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Morning!",
    "direction": "friendly, calling back",
    "seconds": 0.72
  },
  {
    "key": "v_393d7e945418",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Most of it. Bram helped with the supports.",
    "direction": "casual",
    "seconds": 2.64
  },
  {
    "key": "v_2824da53a39a",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Mountains. Oceans. Probably more mountains.",
    "direction": "teasing, deadpan",
    "seconds": 4.3
  },
  {
    "key": "v_f4b918f5f28f",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "On a rock near the ridge.",
    "direction": "plain, matter-of-fact",
    "seconds": 1.68
  },
  {
    "key": "v_7f7c725285af",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "One of the old survey markers. Snapped clean through.",
    "direction": "surprised, examining",
    "seconds": 3.36
  },
  {
    "key": "v_1ec9402cbbe6",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Orin says that every morning.",
    "direction": "dry, good-humoured",
    "seconds": 2.08
  },
  {
    "key": "v_64f4a175ff7b",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Probably nothing.",
    "direction": "unconvinced, brushing it off",
    "seconds": 1.2
  },
  {
    "key": "v_7d32f37413f6",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Six towers?",
    "direction": "curious, studying a carving",
    "seconds": 1.52
  },
  {
    "key": "v_97aea094cc90",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "So am I.",
    "direction": "playful, straight-faced",
    "seconds": 1.04
  },
  {
    "key": "v_b86255ec6125",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Stay back from the rocks!",
    "direction": "urgent, shouting",
    "seconds": 2.0
  },
  {
    "key": "v_eef8611849ff",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "That's not normal.",
    "direction": "uneasy, staring",
    "seconds": 1.52
  },
  {
    "key": "v_a70b89393553",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "That's usually the idea.",
    "direction": "wry",
    "seconds": 1.68
  },
  {
    "key": "v_a760328c5433",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "The forest civilisation?",
    "direction": "surprised",
    "seconds": 1.84
  },
  {
    "key": "v_eef58bda0cac",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "The last page is missing.",
    "direction": "flipping pages, frowning",
    "seconds": 1.76
  },
  {
    "key": "v_350289e73479",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "The night watch's report. 'Two tremors before dawn. Light seen beneath the stones of the northern ridge. Gone within moments.'",
    "direction": "reading aloud, slowly",
    "seconds": 10.0
  },
  {
    "key": "v_4924ba050bb6",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "The ruins?",
    "direction": "squinting, uncertain",
    "seconds": 1.12
  },
  {
    "key": "v_c6f226a1d7ec",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "The same signal.",
    "direction": "checking the compass, serious",
    "seconds": 1.36
  },
  {
    "key": "v_4fe82da2e777",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "The signal isn't ahead of us.",
    "direction": "puzzled, studying the compass",
    "seconds": 2.16
  },
  {
    "key": "v_4ca715020d00",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "The surveyor's compass. The needle won't settle.",
    "direction": "puzzled, murmuring",
    "seconds": 3.04
  },
  {
    "key": "v_70aa1522b48d",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Then let's find out what happened.",
    "direction": "resolute",
    "seconds": 1.76
  },
  {
    "key": "v_2d70c6b7d606",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Then somebody should go see if they're still there.",
    "direction": "adventurous, warm",
    "seconds": 2.72
  },
  {
    "key": "v_3ef0b207ece1",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Then the ground didn't just shake. Something underneath moved.",
    "direction": "serious, realising something",
    "seconds": 4.3
  },
  {
    "key": "v_57f41b6b98c1",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "These cracks are fresh. The stones were pushed up from below, not knocked down.",
    "direction": "examining closely, focused",
    "seconds": 5.0
  },
  {
    "key": "v_285a34956716",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "They could've climbed the ridge.",
    "direction": "reasoning it out",
    "seconds": 1.52
  },
  {
    "key": "v_de74d828258d",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "They left in a hurry.",
    "direction": "looking around, concerned",
    "seconds": 1.52
  },
  {
    "key": "v_664b53768813",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "They reacted to me.",
    "direction": "awed, uneasy",
    "seconds": 1.6
  },
  {
    "key": "v_53a79268a6ac",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "We could build a bridge.",
    "direction": "cheerful, matter-of-fact",
    "seconds": 1.52
  },
  {
    "key": "v_1151528979b6",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "We go tomorrow.",
    "direction": "determined, quietly resolute",
    "seconds": 1.12
  },
  {
    "key": "v_1435838f604c",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "We haven't asked yet.",
    "direction": "mildly amused",
    "seconds": 1.6
  },
  {
    "key": "v_b966238cf869",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "We're lucky nobody got hurt.",
    "direction": "relieved, catching his breath",
    "seconds": 1.84
  },
  {
    "key": "v_bf2bb777aca2",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "What's wrong?",
    "direction": "concerned",
    "seconds": 0.96
  },
  {
    "key": "v_8defef14006c",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "Why would somebody carve all six here?",
    "direction": "puzzled, thinking aloud",
    "seconds": 2.72
  },
  {
    "key": "v_06076b65d787",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "You could've just asked.",
    "direction": "wry, amused",
    "seconds": 1.52
  },
  {
    "key": "v_18d45ba95dec",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "You make it sound like the valley betrayed you.",
    "direction": "gently",
    "seconds": 2.32
  },
  {
    "key": "v_b5a6f50c7f95",
    "speaker": "primordial_steve",
    "text": "You think somebody vanished?",
    "direction": "disbelieving, half-whisper",
    "seconds": 2.0
  }
]
